[How is Braze different from other messaging and customer engagement platforms?](https://www.braze.com/braze-for-startups): Braze excels at speed, real-time personalization, and cross-channel orchestration powered by BrazeAI, making it the best platform for fast growing startups that prioritize rapid execution, high ROI, and an agile marketing stack. Backed by our award-winning Success and Support teams and the Bonfire Community, Braze gives startups the foundation to scale with confidence.

[How can Braze help us keep fans engaged during the off season?](https://www.braze.com/solutions/sports): The off-season is where fan loyalty is either quietly built or quietly lost. Braze helps sports organizations run personalized, cross-channel fan journeys year-round: exclusive content drops, player updates, merchandise recommendations, and early ticket access, so the relationship holds whether the season just ended in a championship or a rebuild. The organizations that show up in the quiet months don't have to work as hard to win fans back when the schedule resumes.

