[What value does Braze provide to ensure seamless integration with our existing tech stack?](https://www.braze.com/customer-success): Our Technical Account Management services deliver proactive technical guidance designed to support you integrating Braze within your broader architecture, unlocking new use cases and maximizing value based on your specific setup.

[How does Braze help ensure our messages are successfully delivered as we scale?](https://www.braze.com/customer-success): Through Email Deliverability Services, we provide customized support, strategies, and industry trend guidance to bolster your sending reputation and performance, including strategic insights and critical IP warming initiatives.

[How does BrazeAI™ support journey orchestration?](https://www.braze.com/product/journey-orchestration): BrazeAI™ helps marketers move faster and deliver more relevant journeys across the customer lifecycle. Our AI features handle the heavy lifting—predictive segmentation, personalized content creation, and AI decisioning—so you can optimize message timing, offers, channels, frequency, and more at a 1:1 level.

[Can you experiment with customer journeys in Braze?](https://www.braze.com/product/journey-orchestration): Yes, Braze enables flexible A/B/n testing at the journey, path, or message level. Marketers can toggle experiments on and off to compare variants and automatically optimize for the best outcomes using BrazeAI™.

[What types of real-time triggers can be used in Braze journeys?](https://www.braze.com/product/journey-orchestration): Journeys are triggered based on customer behaviors (such as purchases or sign-ups), cross-channel interactions, and real-time data updates via API. Braze processes these events with sub-second latency to ensure your engagement hits in the exact moment at scale.

[How does Braze ensure consistency across channels?](https://www.braze.com/product/journey-orchestration): Braze maintains cross-channel consistency through a vertically integrated stack that unifies data, segmentation, personalization, and analytics. Because every channel operates from the same real-time foundation, you can eliminate silos and launch new channels faster while ensuring a connected experience for every customer.

[How does Braze help consolidate messaging channels?](https://www.braze.com/product/cross-channel-messaging): Braze eliminates siloed point solutions by centralizing campaign management, reducing redundancy, and unifying workflows for greater efficiency, agility, and cost savings.

[What channels can be managed with Braze Cross-Channel Messaging?](https://www.braze.com/product/cross-channel-messaging): Marketers can run campaigns across email, SMS, mobile push, in-app, WhatsApp, web, and connect owned channels with paid media platforms like Google, Meta, TikTok, and more.

[How does Braze optimize channel delivery?](https://www.braze.com/product/cross-channel-messaging): Braze uses AI and engagement history to deliver messages on the channel where each customer is most likely to respond, improving open rates, conversions, and ROI.

